<title>USA: ACE*COMM IPO underwriters buy more shares.</title>
<headline>ACE*COMM IPO underwriters buy more shares.</headline>
<dateline>GAITHERSBURG, Md. 1996-09-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>ACE*COMM Corp said on Monday the underwriters for its initial public offering of common stock were going to purchase additional shares to cover over-allotments.</p>
<p>Furman Selz LLC, Oppenheimer &amp; Co and Rodman &amp; Renshaw Inc, the offering's co-managers, notified the company the underwriters would purchase an additional 375,000 shares at the initial public offering price for an aggregate of $2,441,250 in additional net proceeds to the company, it said.</p>
</text>
